{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a quiet evening, Inky nestled into his favorite pillow and closed his eyes, expecting the comfort of familiar feline dreams. Yet instead of playful mice and rivers of milk, he slipped into something far more unusual\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/56142d06fecc859bb145689672881728.poster.avif?t=1758969957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/56142d06fecc859bb145689672881728.webm?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/56142d06fecc859bb145689672881728.mp4?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unsuspecting cat was pulled into a shadowy realm of withered, breathing walls and twisting, claustrophobic tunnels. Whispers from nowhere filled the air as the ground quaked under the weight of approaching footsteps. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/69c5961d9a772e544f44cdb23a7d2a15.poster.avif?t=1758969957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/69c5961d9a772e544f44cdb23a7d2a15.webm?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/69c5961d9a772e544f44cdb23a7d2a15.mp4?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Is this all just a dream?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Inky, you\u2019ll venture through his eerie dreamscape \u2014 deciphering arcane glyph puzzles, crawling through boxes that open into hidden dimensions, chasing a mischievous ball of living yarn, and evading dark ghastly creatures that infest the dream. Venture inward to the depths to dispel the gloom from beyond. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/1f7041380dbe100a6ac2f169a836ed08.poster.avif?t=1758969957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/1f7041380dbe100a6ac2f169a836ed08.webm?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/1f7041380dbe100a6ac2f169a836ed08.mp4?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Game Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spine-chilling claustrophobic atmosphere intertwined with unexpected humorous and cute moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main storyline is conveyed through visual imagery and emotions, remaining <span class=\"bb_strike\">almost</span> understandable without words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rich sound design, coupled with the mesmerizing melodies written by Stewart Keller (composer of Juice Galaxy), will give you a vivid audio experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles, many of which have randomized solutions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, grotesque monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden rooms containing beautiful collars for Inky. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/7832c2cb66627391aa541592f4e4a5b2.poster.avif?t=1758969957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/7832c2cb66627391aa541592f4e4a5b2.webm?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/7832c2cb66627391aa541592f4e4a5b2.mp4?t=1758969957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996640?t=1758969957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996640?t=1758969957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/17fcf97caca43ce6ddef8e555ab67866f0bb1e19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758969957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/17fcf97caca43ce6ddef8e555ab67866f0bb1e19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758969957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a quiet evening, Inky nestled into his favorite pillow and closed his eyes, expecting the comfort of familiar feline dreams. Yet instead of playful mice and rivers of milk, he slipped into something far more unusual\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/extras/56142d06fecc859bb145689672881728.poster.avif?t=1758969957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s