:"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996640/faab840500cdb68e5d8118598b2266b469361896/ss_faab840500cdb68e5d8118598b2266b469361896.600x338.jpg?t=1758969957"}],"short_description":"Step into Inky\u2019s sleep \u2014 a haunting yet enchanting 2D horror-adventure with surreal touches, led by an endearing little cat. Explore dark dreams, unravel uncanny puzzles, and evade otherworldly creatures.","steam_appid":3996640,"support_info":{"email":"timlarik01@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Russian","type":"game","website":null}